Sigma rules (SigmaHQ): PowerShell script rules (Windows ps_script) of the core package, release r2026-07-01

The files in source/ are Sigma rules taken, unmodified, from the release package sigma_core.zip of
https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma (release r2026-07-01; the commit and the SHA-256 of the package are in PROVENANCE.json).

The rules are released under the Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1:
https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License

The license asks, among other things, for the author of a rule to be named when the rules are shared and in every
message that is based on a match of a rule. Each rule file keeps its "author" field, and the colony names the author
of the rule in every warning that a match produces. The rule set itself is at https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma .

This NOTICE was written by the colony project. It is not a file of the upstream repository; the text of the license is
at the address above.
